      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'll start explaining the operation. First of all...",
      "translation" : "我來說明行動內容。首先..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]",
      "translation" : "[埃琳娜·沃爾科娃]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'll start explaining the operation. First of all...",
      "translation" : "我來說明行動內容。首先..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "...... now you can run wild.",
      "translation" : "...現在你們可以放開手腳行動了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Something seems to have exploded over there. The flames have risen from the front!",
      "translation" : "那邊好像發生了爆炸。前方燃起了火焰！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 149,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There are 4 identified locations these explosion came from! I have ^FF0000shown them on your minimap.^000000",
      "translation" : "已經確認有4個爆炸地點！我已在你的小地圖上^FF0000標出位置。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]",
      "translation" : "[埃琳娜·沃爾科娃]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's quite sudden but, I'm changing the operation.",
      "translation" : "雖然有些突然，但我要改變行動計劃。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Don't worry about those already at the front, they adjust to any situation.",
      "translation" : "不用擔心已經在前線的人，他們能應對各種情況。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]",
      "translation" : "[埃琳娜·沃爾科娃]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Divide into 4 teams, everyone at their own locations and start suppressing the leads. If any team finds Elyumina, let us know immediately.",
      "translation" : "分成4支小隊，分別前往各自地點，開始搜查線索。如果有小隊發現艾露米娜，立刻通知我們。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 163,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]",
      "translation" : "[埃琳娜·沃爾科娃]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Everyone, to your position! Start the operation!",
      "translation" : "所有人各就各位！開始行動！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]",
      "translation" : "[埃琳娜·沃爾科娃]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 174,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I ask you to act separately adventurer. Please check your ^0000CDminimap^000000 to organize the situation as quickly as possible. Join the team if they need support!",
      "translation" : "冒險者，請你單獨行動。檢視^0000CD小地圖^000000，儘快掌握情況。需要支援時加入小隊！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 185,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]",
      "translation" : "[埃琳娜·沃爾科娃]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 186,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The briefing... the criminal here will be the one to do it.",
      "translation" : "簡報...就讓這裡的犯人來說明吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 187,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's hard to babysit criminals.",
      "translation" : "照看犯人真麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 191,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]",
      "translation" : "[艾露米娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 192,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Haha! Isn't that your job? Do it properly. Why are you leaving the briefing to me?",
      "translation" : "哈哈！這不是你的工作嗎？好好做啊。為什麼把簡報交給我？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 196,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]",
      "translation" : "[埃琳娜·沃爾科娃]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 197,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So noisy. Before we get started. Are you part of the USU now?",
      "translation" : "真吵。開始之前，你現在是USU的一員了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 201,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]",
      "translation" : "[艾露米娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 202,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "That, that's what he said... are you afraid that I'll be scared!",
      "translation" : "他、他就是這麼說的...你是怕我會害怕嗎！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 203,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Heh, I'll do the explaining because I want to take care of my children!",
      "translation" : "哼，我來說明，因為我要照顧我的孩子們！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 207,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]",
      "translation" : "[艾露米娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "... Okay, it's almost time.",
      "translation" : "...好吧，差不多到時間了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 209,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "My children will start setting up traps in <TIPBOX>[four places]<INFO>8086</INFO></TIPBOX>.",
      "translation" : "我的孩子們會開始在<TIPBOX>[四處地點]<INFO>8086</INFO></TIPBOX>佈置陷阱。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 212,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]",
      "translation" : "[艾露米娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 213,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Here, take the map. The information will also be delivered to the party members as well.",
      "translation" : "給，拿著地圖。相關資訊也會發送給隊伍成員。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 214,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You aren't alone right? You know my children are powerful?",
      "translation" : "你不是一個人來的吧？你知道我的孩子們有多厲害嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 222,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]",
      "translation" : "[艾露米娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 223,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Go ahead and touch the traps. The traps will activate and my lovely children will appear.",
      "translation" : "去觸發那些陷阱吧。陷阱啟動後，我可愛的孩子們就會出現。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 224,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You do remember how the traps work, right?",
      "translation" : "你還記得陷阱怎麼運作吧？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 228,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]",
      "translation" : "[艾露米娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 229,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "After you've cleared the four traps, EL1_A17T will come out, and this lady here will bring you to the same place as last time.",
      "translation" : "清除四個陷阱後，EL1_A17T就會出現，這位女士會把你帶到上次去的地方。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 233,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]",
      "translation" : "[艾露米娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 234,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "That's it for the explanation. Now, get to work! Muscle idiots! Ahahaha!",
      "translation" : "說明到此為止。現在開工吧！一群肌肉笨蛋！啊哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 239,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elena Volkova]",
      "translation" : "[埃琳娜·沃爾科娃]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 240,
      "npc" : "Elena Volkova",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "...I'll have a conversation with this criminal in a bit... Anyways. I'm counting on you, adventurers!",
      "translation" : "...我待會兒要和這個犯人談談...總之，冒險者們，拜託你們了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 260,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]",
      "translation" : "[艾露米娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 261,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "That was fast... It was expected that my kids wouldn't win though.",
      "translation" : "真快...不過我早就料到我的孩子們會輸。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 262,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There's a lot more trouble going on up there~",
      "translation" : "上面還有更麻煩的事情呢~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 266,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]",
      "translation" : "[艾露米娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 267,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "... are you going straight for my EL1-A17T?",
      "translation" : "...你要直接去找我的EL1-A17T嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 271,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Go in.",
      "translation" : "進去。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 271,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Don't go in yet.",
      "translation" : "暫時別進去。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 273,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]",
      "translation" : "[艾露米娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 274,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Come on, I was about to open it.",
      "translation" : "來嘛，我正準備開啟呢。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 278,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Elyumina]",
      "translation" : "[艾露米娜]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 279,
      "npc" : "Elyumina",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hahaha! Yes. Let's work hard. Gather more battle data for me!",
      "translation" : "哈哈哈！沒錯。好好努力，為我收集更多戰鬥資料！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 300,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 301,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There is a suspicious box! A signal is being transmitted from the inside, it's currently being decrypted!",
      "translation" : "發現了一個可疑的箱子！裡面正在發出訊號，目前正在解碼！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 306,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 307,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Destroy the Biological Battery and kill the monsters!",
      "translation" : "摧毀生物電池，消滅怪物！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 312,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 313,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sorry for the late analysis. It wasn't a device to summon monsters.",
      "translation" : "抱歉，分析得有些晚了。那不是召喚怪物的裝置。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 315,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 316,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "After summoning the monsters, it summons a bio-battery to strengthen the monsters and explodes.",
      "translation" : "召喚怪物後，它還會召出一枚生物電池來強化怪物，隨後發生爆炸。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 318,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 319,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you want to handle it, just destroy it. It's good because it's a simple solution.",
      "translation" : "想解決它的話，直接摧毀就行。簡單有效。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 321,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 322,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well, it looks like this is over....",
      "translation" : "好了，看起來這邊已經結束了..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 324,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 325,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It looks like you've found something interesting here. You should check out the other teams!",
      "translation" : "看來你在這裡發現了有趣的東西。去看看其他小隊吧！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 341,
      "npc" : "Box",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 342,
      "npc" : "Box",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The cause of the explosion is unknown, but I've found this suspicious box at the site. It seems to be some type of mechanism.",
      "translation" : "爆炸原因不明，不過我在現場發現了這個可疑箱子。它似乎是某種裝置。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 344,
      "npc" : "Box",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 345,
      "npc" : "Box",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There is a signal being transmitted from the inside... Huh, be careful. Something's happening!",
      "translation" : "裡面有訊號正在傳出...咦，小心！有情況！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 354,
      "npc" : "Box",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 355,
      "npc" : "Box",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Destroy the Biological Battery and kill the monsters!",
      "translation" : "摧毀生物電池，消滅怪物！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 461,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 462,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There is a suspicious box! A signal is being transmitted from the inside, it's currently being decrypted!",
      "translation" : "發現了一個可疑的箱子！裡面正在發出訊號，目前正在解碼！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 467,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 468,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Avoid the Chemical Poison and kill the monsters!",
      "translation" : "避開化學毒素，消滅怪物！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 473,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 474,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's an awful but interesting device. It wasn't a device meant to summon monsters.",
      "translation" : "這裝置又糟糕又有趣。它並不是用來召喚怪物的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 476,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛軍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 477,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
